[*] --> No Budget Set

No Budget Set --> Budget Allocated : User sets budget allocations
Budget Allocated --> Tracking Expenses : Start tracking expenses
Tracking Expenses --> Exceeded Budget : Expense exceeds allocation
Exceeded Budget --> Tracking Expenses : Adjust expenses
Exceeded Budget --> Budget Allocated : Adjust budget allocations
Tracking Expenses --> [*] : Complete budget tracking
